From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minimal <noreply@minimal.dev>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(container): join a caller-supplied cgroup before
 unsharing

Container::cgroup takes an open cgroup v2 directory. The container's
first process writes itself into that cgroup before it creates any
namespace, so every process of the container starts in the cgroup and
a new cgroup namespace is rooted there.
---
 hakoniwa/src/container.rs        | 15 ++++++++
 hakoniwa/src/runc.rs             |  5 +++
 hakoniwa/src/runc/sys.rs         |  8 +++++
 hakoniwa/tests/container_test.rs | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 90 insertions(+)

